The directories corpus/mistral-docs and corpus/snapshots contain documentation
from Mistral AI's public documentation repository,
https://github.com/mistralai/platform-docs-public.git, converted to normalized
Markdown at the commits recorded in their manifests.

Site: https://docs.mistral.ai

The upstream repository is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Each corpus
directory contains a copy as LICENSE. The content also derives from the OpenAPI
specification published at https://docs.mistral.ai/openapi.yaml and the model
catalog in the same repository. Each page records its upstream source path and
commit in frontmatter.
